{"version":1,"key":"card:116","content":{"id":116,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"当我们借用一个变量时，如果变量被销毁，那么我们就不能通过该借用的引用访问数据，因为变量以及被销毁了，此时访问的数据是不可知的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8bb77699-ad52-425f-8707-06818d2bc172","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn main() {\n  let x;\n  {\n    let y = 5;\n    x = &y;\n  }\n  println!(\"{}\", x);\n}","collabId":"2b6d1f3f-7fe3-4514-9cef-9f138a470c47","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"4dac4644-191d-4bac-888b-369ddc840485","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4a4d8815-d18a-4337-80df-fb3057a1ee0c"},{"children":[{"text":"如果我们尝试编译该代码，编译器将会给出错误","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"509143a8-5e58-4dec-8d0f-8cb5609d9937","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"error[E0597]: `y` does not live long enough\n --> hello5.rs:5:9\n  |\n5 |     x = &y;\n  |         ^^ borrowed value does not live long enough\n6 |   }\n  |   - `y` dropped here while still borrowed\n7 |   println!(\"{}\", x);\n  |                  - borrow later used here\n\nerror: aborting due to previous error\n\nFor more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0597`.","collabId":"e72271a5-0ab4-4f8c-8383-3ed107309bea","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b9ca35d3-a585-4057-907d-79c29e00e0e2","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"1bd5b1d4-986e-427d-9447-d1c3600933f4"},{"children":[{"text":"我们使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量借用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的引用，但是在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量销毁以后，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变量就不能访问 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的数据了，它是一个悬空指针。好在我们不需要担心这个问题，编译器可以找到问题并为我们解决。编译器要解决这个问题，就得知道变量的生命周期，例如上面 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x, y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的生命周期。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"89ef9f67-5f62-4044-835c-724560b5e095","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但是如果函数返回一个引用的话，在编译时时不知道函数返回的变量的生命周期的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f2d8c60a-6689-4b72-91c4-a79e6b930e31","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn get_one(x: &i32, y: &i32) -> &i32 {\n  &x\n}","collabId":"6346798d-99ba-4810-bece-55e4044616d4","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"541303e0-028a-4b2e-9253-b313adee6eee","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"be9627ee-7b32-4e1b-ae6d-0dfe392e80cd"},{"children":[{"text":"如果我们尝试定义上面的函数，编译器会给出一个错误","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e25a2bf4-cd2e-4b5d-b7e1-547b6bbdea27","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"error[E0106]: missing lifetime specifier\n  --> hello6.rs:13:33\n   |\n13 | fn get_one(x: &i32, y: &i32) -> &i32 {\n   |               ----     ----     ^ expected named lifetime parameter\n   |\n   = help: this function's return type contains a borrowed value, but the signature does not say whether it is borrowed from `x` or `y`\nhelp: consider introducing a named lifetime parameter\n   |\n13 | fn get_one<'a>(x: &'a i32, y: &'a i32) -> &'a i32 {\n   |           ++++     ++          ++          ++\n\nerror: aborting due to previous error\n\nFor more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0106`.","collabId":"52341f86-3b22-4762-a5ed-756a1973174f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"ed1b9078-8ad8-4837-b40c-f944dd242d76","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"3e568cf2-c2c4-42d0-b8b5-f1e12af715ce"},{"children":[{"text":"这是因为编译器不知道返回的引用的生命周期，如果不知道生命周期的话，它就不能检测悬空指针的问题，所以编译就不会通过，我们需要手动指定返回的引用的生命周期。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ad631ab2-8323-4ce5-924f-0b2d3e8e59d2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如何指定呢？在我们定义函数时，需要为变量添加生命周期标记，生命周期标记使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 开头，后面跟若干字符用于标记，一般我们使用单个字符，如 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a, 'b","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bccf8f9f-61d4-4cf3-9624-caf06b63e6b5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn get_one<'a, 'b>(x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32) -> &'a i32 {\n  &x\n}","collabId":"89001dca-ac66-4025-b695-92021b591f81","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0f3885e8-c244-4761-b024-0a2b8c62d566","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"192459f8-dca6-451d-83d4-1a48742ab621"},{"children":[{"text":"上面我们添加的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a, 'b","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就是生命周期标记，对于方法中使用的标记，都要在方法名后的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中声明，例如 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"add<'a, 'b>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，方法的输入分别被标记了不同的生命周期符号，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示它们具有不同的生命周期，返回的引用的生命周期时 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，说明它与 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x: &'a i32","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的生命周期相同。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af27a50c-fe42-4d50-832c-50173a5a98a3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"具有这些信息，编译器就可以检测悬空指针的问题了。看下面的一个例子：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"375ff554-5f3c-4edd-a542-b3c036da7d59","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn main() {\n  let x = 1;\n  let z;\n  {\n    let y = 2;\n    z = get_one(&x, &y);\n  }\n\n  println!(\"{}\", z);\n}\n\nfn get_one<'a, 'b>(x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32) -> &'b i32 {\n  &y\n}","collabId":"f296b071-ecbd-416b-bc3e-24e57c330b55","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f75b22d0-c3f1-4b8f-b076-058c28fe3f5c","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b8b969d3-f31f-415f-b910-f519c0101c37"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"get_one","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数接收两个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"i32","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的引用，分别声明了不同的生命周期，然后返回一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"i32","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的引用，其生命周期为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'b","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，与第二个参数的生命周期相同。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2689bb22-e791-4f5c-ad95-0a20b22ae1a6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"然后我们在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"main","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数中调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"get_one","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，分别传入 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"&x, &y","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，返回的引用赋值给 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"z","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，返回的引用的生命周期与第二个参数相同，也就是与 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 相同，那么我们就不能在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的生命周期之外访问 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"z","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，否则就会导致悬空指针的问题，但是上面的程序中我们在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 所在的块之外访问了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"z","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，所以会编译出错","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c7c0ecb3-d33f-4327-bfe0-80de4fe19ae5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"warning: unused variable: `x`\n  --> hello6.rs:13:20\n   |\n13 | fn get_one<'a, 'b>(x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32) -> &'b i32 {\n   |                    ^ help: if this is intentional, prefix it with an underscore: `_x`\n   |\n   = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` on by default\n\nerror[E0597]: `y` does not live long enough\n --> hello6.rs:6:21\n  |\n6 |     z = get_one(&x, &y);\n  |                     ^^ borrowed value does not live long enough\n7 |   }\n  |   - `y` dropped here while still borrowed\n8 |\n9 |   println!(\"{}\", z);\n  |                  - borrow later used here\n\nerror: aborting due to previous error; 1 warning emitted\n\nFor more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0597`.","collabId":"14bea9c6-6a6b-4d50-96c0-dc1dc7efdf61","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"eb20f6cf-50a7-4522-9897-b69432399632","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"79a3bab0-bb2a-4f10-8b22-ed0e886d0fc5"},{"children":[{"text":"给出的错误是说，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 已经被销毁了，但是在后面被引用的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"z","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 使用了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"067fe6be-13f4-45c4-a1a3-a6e039fd69ca","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果我们修改上面的函数为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fa9e7e03-b0cd-4523-b44f-9fbcf6d11dbf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn get_one<'a, 'b>(x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32) -> &'a i32 {\n  &x\n}","collabId":"decf827c-371d-47b7-8dc1-8344b12e5f66","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b89d9994-c449-46f5-9268-6abdd36bb4fe","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f7ec2176-f9ed-4c60-843f-4f37621bb9ff"},{"children":[{"text":"这个时候我们返回的引用的生命周期是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，与第一个参数的生命周期相同，这个时候我们调用函数，因为返回的引用的生命周期与 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的生命周相同，在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 被销毁以前都可以使用，所以程序可以正确编译。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3e6045eb-8e38-46a1-bd66-a020be86a611","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"warning: unused variable: `y`\n  --> hello6.rs:13:32\n   |\n13 | fn get_one<'a, 'b>(x: &'a i32, y: &'b i32) -> &'a i32 {\n   |                                ^ help: if this is intentional, prefix it with an underscore: `_y`\n   |\n   = note: `#[warn(unused_variables)]` on by default\n\nwarning: 1 warning emitted\n\n1","collabId":"b15cc590-e6da-499b-a3f6-aa22cbd4dcb9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"63455a63-0f18-452a-abaa-e24b3864b7dd","language":"rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f71bd1b1-bd8b-4301-a3fa-4cf0027c4d92"},{"children":[{"text":"程序正确打印出了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的值 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"1","type":"formatted"},{"text":"（当然还给出了一些警告，因为我们在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"get_one","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数里面只用了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，没有用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":"）。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5cda2140-542a-4b6d-8e45-7570b1f5e674","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"上面为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"x","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"y","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标注了不同的生命周期，如果为二者使用","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"相同的生命周期","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"00b653d5-31f3-4b54-8297-c274f4e49535","contentId":346,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":410,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"标注 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 呢，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"'a","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示的生命周期是多大，应当是二者的交集，也就是生命周期最短的那个","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"baf2352a-5904-413a-807c-8b6fd8b04fb8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fn get_one<'a>(x: &'a i32, y: &'a i32) -> &'a i32 {\n  &x + &y\n}","collabId":"321d8e19-41b5-4fef-9125-eb4ceca98461","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8eb9b3df-82a3-4fd2-ace5-dc9ae68c56af","language":"Rust","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"bb236152-3a94-44fd-a6a2-441c2f9c9852"}],"tags":["Rust/生命周期"],"createTime":1689256093808,"updateTime":1793532517417,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532517417},"links":{"card:410":{"key":"card:410","type":"card","id":410}}}